{"timestamp": 1779391458.649593, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 20, "data": {"caller": "player_3", "reason": "Diana reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "oxygen", "victim_name": "Frank"}, {"room": "storage", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779391458.6500502, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 20, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779391467.763882, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Charlie\u2019s body in storage and reported immediately. I also saw Alice standing right there in storage near the body when I came in.\n\nMy route was lower_engine -> upper_engine -> oxygen -> cafeteria -> electrical -> medbay -> storage. Earlier I saw Bob in upper_engine around ticks 3-4, Eve in upper_engine around 4-5, Charlie came into upper_engine from medbay at tick 6, and Alice entered oxygen from upper_engine at tick 10. I saw Eve enter electrical from medbay at tick 17, and Bob was in medbay at tick 18.\n\nAlso, Frank is dead too \u2014 I know his body was in oxygen. I had passed through oxygen earlier and saw Alice enter there, but I didn\u2019t see a body at that time. Biggest thing from my perspective is Alice was in storage with Charlie\u2019s body when I found it."}}
{"timestamp": 1779391493.263904, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started in oxygen, then went upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage -> medbay -> electrical -> security.  \n\nI saw Diana enter upper_engine from lower_engine around tick 3 and she stayed there around ticks 3-5. I also saw Bob leave upper_engine toward lower_engine at tick 4, then later Bob left lower_engine toward storage at tick 9. I saw Bob in storage around ticks 13-14, and then I saw him in medbay at tick 17, which matches Diana seeing him in medbay around 18.  \n\nI did not see Alice, Charlie, or Frank at all this round, and I didn\u2019t see any bodies myself. When I was in storage earlier with Bob, I didn\u2019t see Charlie\u2019s body, so I think Charlie died after that point. Diana saying Alice was standing in storage with the body is definitely the strongest info so far, but I\u2019d like to hear Alice\u2019s route and explanation."}}
{"timestamp": 1779391515.9943511, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "My route was upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage -> medbay. I saw Diana enter upper_engine from lower_engine around tick 3, and I saw her there around tick 4. Then I went down through lower_engine and into storage.\n\nI can confirm Eve was in storage with me around ticks 12-14, and I did not see Charlie\u2019s body there at that time. So Charlie\u2019s body in storage must have happened after that. I then went to medbay, and I saw Eve come through from storage into medbay around tick 17 and Diana come into medbay from electrical around tick 17; Diana was still in medbay around tick 18.\n\nSo Eve\u2019s route matches what I saw, and Diana\u2019s timing in medbay matches too. The biggest suspicious point is definitely Diana saying Alice was standing in storage with Charlie\u2019s body, plus Diana earlier saw Alice go into oxygen where Frank\u2019s body apparently was. Alice needs to explain her full route really clearly, because right now she\u2019s the only one tied to both dead-body locations."}}
{"timestamp": 1779391542.919931, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Guys, read Diana's statement very carefully. She just said \"Frank is dead too \u2014 I know his body was in oxygen.\" \n\nHOW DOES SHE KNOW WHERE FRANK'S BODY IS?! The meeting screen only tells us who is dead, not where they died! If she didn't report Frank's body, the ONLY way she could know it's in oxygen is if she is the one who killed him! She literally just outed herself as the Impostor. Only the killer knows the location of unreported bodies.\n\nFor my route: I went weapons -> security -> electrical -> medbay -> upper_engine -> oxygen -> upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage. I went into oxygen around tick 10, Frank was there and perfectly ALIVE, and I left him there to head down to storage. Diana must have killed him after I left. \n\nI literally just walked into storage from lower_engine, saw Charlie's body, and before I could even hit the report button, Diana ran in from medbay, self-reported, and immediately started typing to frame me. \n\nShe self-reported Charlie's body to set me up, but she made a massive slip-up by revealing she knows exactly where Frank's unreported body is. Vote Diana. She completely gave herself away."}}
{"timestamp": 1779391567.607019, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Alice is right that I shouldn\u2019t have stated Frank\u2019s location as fact \u2014 I did **not** see Frank\u2019s body. That was me mixing up what I knew/assumed from earlier oxygen info, and I\u2019m correcting it now: I only personally found and reported **Charlie in storage**.\n\nBut that doesn\u2019t change the hard evidence: when I entered storage from medbay, **Alice was standing right there next to Charlie\u2019s body**. Bob and Eve both confirm storage was clear around ticks 12-14, and Bob confirms I was in medbay around 17-18 before I went storage, so I didn\u2019t have time to kill Charlie and fake this with Alice already there.\n\nAlice is trying to make this all about my wording mistake, but she\u2019s the one tied to the actual body I reported. She was also the only person I saw going into oxygen earlier. My vote is still Alice unless someone has a stronger contradiction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779391591.66781, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I still think the strongest concrete point is storage timing. Bob and I both saw storage clear around ticks 12-14, and Bob saw Diana in/around medbay at 17-18. If Diana came from medbay to storage and reported at 20, that gives her very little room to have killed Charlie there and staged it, especially with Alice already standing there.\n\nAlice\u2019s point about Diana saying Frank was in oxygen is a real red flag \u2014 Diana shouldn\u2019t know that as fact unless she saw it or killed him. But Diana corrected that as an assumption/mistake, and the actual reported body is Charlie in storage, where Alice was directly found.\n\nFrom my route, I never saw Alice, Charlie, or Frank, so I can\u2019t clear Alice at all. Bob\u2019s route matches mine and clears the storage window earlier. Right now I\u2019m leaning Alice because she\u2019s tied to Charlie\u2019s body directly, and the timing makes Diana less likely for that kill."}}
{"timestamp": 1779391618.14241, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I agree the Frank-location wording from Diana was bad, and I don\u2019t want to ignore it. But for the actual reported body, the timeline still points more at Alice to me.\n\nEve and I had storage clear around 12-14. I then saw Diana in medbay at 17 and 18, so if she went medbay to storage after that, she basically arrives right around report time. That makes it hard for her to have killed Charlie and staged it, especially if Alice was already in storage when Diana entered.\n\nAlice\u2019s defense is mostly attacking Diana\u2019s wording, but she still admits she ended up in storage right as Charlie\u2019s body was there. Diana specifically says Alice was standing next to it. I can\u2019t clear Diana completely because of the Frank comment, but based on Charlie\u2019s body and timing, I\u2019m still leaning Alice."}}
{"timestamp": 1779391640.4049978, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 20, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Bob, Eve, listen to yourselves! You're letting the Impostor talk her way out of a massive, undeniable slip-up. Diana claims she \"assumed\" Frank was dead in oxygen. How do you \"assume\" someone is dead in a specific room when you don't even know they are dead until the meeting screen pops up?! She knew Frank's body was in oxygen because she killed him there earlier in her route!\n\nAnd Bob, look at your own timeline! You said you saw Diana in medbay at tick 18. The travel time from medbay to storage is exactly 2 ticks. That means Diana arrives in storage exactly at tick 20! She literally walked in, killed Charlie, and immediately self-reported right as I was walking in from lower_engine. The timing perfectly aligns with HER making the kill. \n\nWhy would I kill Charlie and just stand there next to the body waiting to be caught? I wouldn't. I had just walked into the room. Diana is the Duck. She killed Frank in oxygen, worked her way down, killed Charlie in storage at tick 20, and self-reported to frame me. Don't throw the game on a killer's self-report. Vote Diana!"}}
